      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Inter" bold="true" color="rgba(15,36,64,1)" wrap="false" textAlign="left">
        <p>What the tests pin down</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="56" topLeftY="136" width="420" height="300">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(61,74,92,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" textAlign="left">
        <ul>
          <li><p>Behavior over implementation: assert status, stored state, and how many times the bank was called - not internal calls.</p></li>
          <li><p>Rejected -&gt; zero bank calls. Retry -&gt; exactly one bank call. Conflict -&gt; 409. Timeout -&gt; record stays INIT.</p></li>
          <li><p>Real timeouts tested against a JDK HttpServer in the integration suite - the hardest case is not mocked.</p></li>
          <li><p>CI gates: line 80%, branch 70% - a regression fails the build.</p></li>
        </ul>
      </content>
    </shape>
